#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "U-qaabeynta caadiga ah ee ifHighSpeed ee madhan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Marka la xisaabinayo Xadadka Muujinta, haddii ifHighSpeed iyo ifSpeed ay soo noqdaan eber, isticmaal dejinta ifHighSpeed ee soo socota beddelkeeda. Qiimaha caadiga ah ee ifHighSpeed wuxux noqon doonaa 10000 isku xirka 10GE."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Doorbidyada Ogeysiiska"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Jooji Ogeysiisyada Hore"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Calaamadaynta sanduuqani waxay joojinaysaa Digniinta Hore ee dhammaan Xadka.  Digniinta Hore waxaa lagu qeexaa Digniin kasta oo Iimayl Gaar ah oo aan la xiriirin Liiska Ogeysiiska."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Ogeysiiska Xadka oo Qaab-dhismeed Leh"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Haddii la calaamadeeyo, marka la abuurayo Qaab-dhismeed Xadka ah, Dejinta Ogeysiiskiisa waxaa sida caadiga ah yeelan doona Qaab-dhismeedka Xadka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Fulinta Amarrada"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Calaamadaynta sanduuqani waxay hawlgelinaysaa awoodda lagu socodsiiyo amarada dhacdooyinka jebinta Xadka iyo soo celinta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Ogeysiinta Thold kasta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Calaamadaynta sanduuqani waxay hawlgelinaysaa awoodda lagu hayo qoraallada Iimayl ee gaarka ah ee Xadka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Safka Ogeysiinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Calaamadaynta sanduuqani waxay ka beddeli doontaa Thold samaynta Ogeysiiska tooska ah una beddeli doontaa isticmaalka Daemon-ka Ogeysiiska, ama ogeysiisyada ka baxsan kooxda ee uu sameeyo Xog-uruuriyaha Ogeysiiska."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Hawlgeli U-dirista Iimayllada Digniinta ee Liisaska Ogeysiinta Digniinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto in qaataayaasha Liiska Ogeysiiska Digniinta ay helaan Iimayllada Digniinta Degdegga ah iyada oo lagu darayo qaataayaasha liiska Ogeysiiska Digniinta Degdegga ah.  Xaaladdan waxaa la adeegsadaa marka Ogeysiisyada Digniinta ay u tagaan Maamulayaasha Nidaamka isla markaana Ogeysiisyada Digniinta Degdegga ah ay u tagaan Maareynta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon-ka Xadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Daemon-ka Xadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Calaamadaynta sanduuqani waxay hawlgelinaysaa isticmaalka Xadka daemon oo gooni ah. Tan waxaa loo isticmaali karaa in lagu kordhiyo waxqabadka nidaamka iyo/ama in lagu qaybiyo kormeerka Xadka server gaar ah."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Ku qasab Cilad-saarka Daemon-ka Xadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Calaamadaynta sanduuqani waxay hawlgelinaysaa sixitaanka Xadka Daemon marka laga shaqaynayo SystemD ama khadka amarka.  Isbeddelkani waa mid firfircoon wuxuuna dhaqangelayaa isla marka uu bilowdo wareegga Xadka ee xiga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Soo noqnoqoshada Ogeysiiska Daemon-ka Dansan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Haddii la ogaado in Thold Daemon uu shaqada joojiyay, u dir ogeysiis Iimayl inta jeer ee tan ah."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "%d Saacad kasta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Threads-ka Daemon-ka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Tirada dunta adeegga (daemon threads) ee uu maareeyo Adeegga Xadka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Hawl"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
