msgstr "%d Hawlo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Diiwaangelinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Diiwaangeli Xad-gudubyada Xadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Hawlgeli diiwaangelinta dhammaan fashilka Xadka ee Diiwaanka Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Muuji Isha Xogta ee Diiwaanka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Muuji magaca Isha Xogta ee Diiwaanka haddii uusan ku jirin."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Diiwaangeli Isbeddellada Xadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Hawlgeli diiwaangelinta dhammaan isbeddellada Xadka ee Diiwaanka Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Diiwaanka Cilad-saarka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Hawlgeli diiwaangelinta fariimaha cilad-saarista ee Xadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Haynta Diiwaanka Feejignaanta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "U hay diiwaannada Xadka tirada maalmahan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Diiwaangeli falka U qaado Xogta Aan La Aqoon Eber ahaan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Marka 'U tixgeli Xogta Aan La Aqoon Sida Ebar' la hawlgeliyo, diiwaangeli marka ay dhacdo"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog La hawlgeliyay"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Haddii la calaamadeeyo, marka la abuurayo Xadka cusub, sida caadiga ah dhacdooyinka Xadka cusub waxaa loo diri doonaa Syslog-gaaga maxalliga ah. Dejintani waa mid horay loo sii dejiyay. Dejinta Xadka ayaa xukunta maamulka dhabta ah ee Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Mudnaanta/Heerka Caadiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Kani waa Mudnaanta/Heerka caadiga ah ee Thold u adeegsan doonto dirista farriimaha Syslog. Dejintani waa mid horay loo sii dejiyay. Dejinta Xadka ayaa xukunta maamulka dhabta ah ee Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Qaybta Caadiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Tani waa Xarunta (Facility) caadiga ah ee Thold u adeegsan doonto dirista farriimaha Syslog. Dejintani waa mid horay loo sii dejiyay. Dejinta Xadka ayaa xukunta maamulka dhabta ah ee Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Dejinta Hore ee Feejignaanta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Ka-dhaafitaannada dhammaadka toddobaadka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Haddii tan la calaamadeeyo, Thold ma shaqayn doono maalmaha fasaxa toddobaadka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Tirada Kicinta ee Caadiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee jeerarka isku xiga ee Isha Xogta ay tahay inay jebiso Xadka si Digniin loo soo saaro."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Digniin-celin"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Ku celi Digniinta ka dib tirada cayiman ee wareegyada xog-uruuriyaha."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Dejimmada Diyaarsan ee Heerka Aasaasiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Xilliga Waqtiga ee Caadiga ah ee Heerka Aasaasiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Kani waa qiimaha caadiga ah ee loo adeegsado abuurista Xadadka ama qaab-dhismeedyada."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Tirada Kicinta Heerka Aasaasiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee jeerarka isku xiga ee Isha Xogta ay tahay inay jebiso Xadka Saldhigga la xisaabiyay si Digniin loo soo saaro."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Boqolleyga Leexashada Heerka Aasaasiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Ogeysiiska SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Ogeysiisyada SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Farriimaha xaaladda Xadka (informs/traps) waxaa loo diri doonaa qaabilayaasha ogeysiisyada SNMP. Tan waxaa si caadi ah ugu jira Ogeysiisyada Khatarta, Digniinaha iyo dabinnada Soo-celinta. Fiiro gaar ah: Astaantani waxay u baahan tahay plugin-ka Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Jooji Ogeysiisyada Digniinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Haddii tan la calaamadeeyo, Xadka ma diri doono ogeysiis marka la jebiyo Xadka digniinta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Jooji Ogeysiisyada Soo-celinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Haddii tan la calaamadeeyo, Xadka ma diri doono ogeysiis marka Xadku ku soo noqdo Xaaladda caadiga ah."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Dirista Iimaylka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "U dir Iimayllada Mudnaanta Degdegga ah leh"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad u dejiso Iimaylada mudnaan degdeg ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "U dir Digniinaha Qoraal ahaan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Haddii la calaamadeeyo, tani waxay sababi doontaa in dhammaan Qaylo-dhaannada loo diro Iimayl qoraal cad ah oo aan lahayn Garaafka. Habka caadiga ah waa Iimayllo HTML ah oo Garaafka ku dhex jiro Iimaylka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "U dir Iimayl si gaar ah cinwaan kasta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Haddii la calaamadeeyo, tani waxay sababi doontaa in dhammaan Iimayllada si gaar ah loogu diro cinwaan kasta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Ciwaanka Iimaylka Diraha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Kani waa cinwaanka Iimaylka ee Xadku uu ka soo muuqan doono."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Magaca Diraha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Kani waa magaca dhabta ah ee Xadku ka soo muuqan doono."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Ogeysiiska Qalabka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Ogeysiisyada"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Hawlgeli ogeysiinta martigeliyaha dhintay/soo kabanaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
