#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Amarka Kicinta Sare"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Haddii la dejiyo, oo la jebiyo Xadka Sare, amarkan waa la fulin doonaa. Fadlan geli amar sax ah. Intaa waxaa dheer, waxaa jira dhowr summadood oo beddelaad ah oo loo isticmaali karo in macluumaad looga gudbiyo Xadka loona gudbiyo qoraalka (script). Waxaad tan u samayn kartaa dood ahaan khadka amarka, ama iyadoo la doorbidayo, deegaanka qoraalka. Dhammaan qiimayaasha beddelaadda waxay ka soo muuqan doonaan deegaanka qoraalka iyagoo leh horgalaha THOLD_. Marka, tusaale ahaan CURRENTVALUE wuxuu noqon doonaa THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, iyo wixii la mid ah. Doorsoomayaasha waxaa ka mid ah: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Ugu dambayn, beddelaadda Martigeliye, Weydiinta Xogta iyo Gelinta Xogta waa la samayn karaa. Tusaale ahaan, haddii aad leedahay xog gaar ah oo gelinta xogta ah oo lagu magacaabo pending, si aad u samayso beddelaadda isticmaal |pending|. Beddelaadda Weydiinta Xogta iyo Martigeliye, isticmaal xeerarka Cacti ee |query_xxxx| iyo |host_xxxx| siday u kala horreeyaan."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Amarka Kicinta Hoose"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Haddii la dejiyo, oo la jebiyo Xadka Hoose, amarkan waa la fulin doonaa. Fadlan geli amar sax ah. Intaa waxaa dheer, waxaa jira dhowr summadood oo beddelaad ah oo loo isticmaali karo in macluumaad looga gudbiyo Xadka loona gudbiyo qoraalka (script). Waxaad tan u samayn kartaa dood ahaan khadka amarka, ama iyadoo la doorbidayo, deegaanka qoraalka. Dhammaan qiimayaasha beddelaadda waxay ka soo muuqan doonaan deegaanka qoraalka iyagoo leh horgalaha THOLD_. Marka, tusaale ahaan CURRENTVALUE wuxuu noqon doonaa THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, iyo wixii la mid ah. Doorsoomayaasha waxaa ka mid ah: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Ugu dambayn, beddelaadda Martigeliye, Weydiinta Xogta iyo Gelinta Xogta waa la samayn karaa. Tusaale ahaan, haddii aad leedahay xog gaar ah oo gelinta xogta ah oo lagu magacaabo pending, si aad u samayso beddelaadda isticmaal |pending|. Beddelaadda Weydiinta Xogta iyo Martigeliye, isticmaal xeerarka Cacti ee |query_xxxx| iyo |host_xxxx| siday u kala horreeyaan."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Amarka Kicinta Caadiga ah"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Haddii la dejiyo, marka thold uu ku soo noqdo qiimo caadi ah, amarkan waa la fulin doonaa. Fadlan geli amar sax ah. Intaa waxaa dheer, waxaa jira dhowr summadood oo beddelaad ah oo loo isticmaali karo in macluumaad looga gudbiyo Xadka loona gudbiyo qoraalka (script). Waxaad tan u samayn kartaa dood ahaan khadka amarka, ama iyadoo la doorbidayo, deegaanka qoraalka. Dhammaan qiimayaasha beddelaadda waxay ka soo muuqan doonaan deegaanka qoraalka iyagoo leh horgalaha THOLD_. Marka, tusaale ahaan CURRENTVALUE wuxuu noqon doonaa THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, iyo wixii la mid ah. Doorsoomayaasha waxaa ka mid ah: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Ugu dambayn, beddelaadda Martigeliye, Weydiinta Xogta iyo Gelinta Xogta waa la samayn karaa. Tusaale ahaan, haddii aad leedahay xog gaar ah oo gelinta xogta ah oo lagu magacaabo pending, si aad u samayso beddelaadda isticmaal |pending|. Beddelaadda Weydiinta Xogta iyo Martigeliye, isticmaal xeerarka Cacti ee |query_xxxx| iyo |host_xxxx| siday u kala horreeyaan."

