#: thold_templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br>Math Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "Weedha RPN waa Weedh RPN oo la jaanqaada RRDtool.  Qaab-qoraalku wuxuu ka kooban yahay dhammaan hawlaha hoose oo ay weheliyaan labada weedh ee beddelka Qalab iyo Weydiinta Xogta sida <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  Si aad ugu isticmaasho Isha Xogta Weedha RPN, waa inaad adeegsataa qaab-qoraalka: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  Tusaale ahaan, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> waxay heli doontaa qiimaha hadda jira ee Isha Xogta traffic_in ee RRDfile(s)-ka la xidhiidha Garaafka. Isha Xogta kasta oo loogu talagalay Garaafka waa lagu dari karaa.<br>Hawlwadeennada Xisaabta: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Hawlaha: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Hawlwadeennada Socodka: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Hawlaha Isbarbardhigga: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

